OL,3,ACanada suspends plans to expand
OL,4,Aassisted dying to people with mental
OL,5,Aillness
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanada says it will indefinitely
OL,8,Fsuspend plans to expand its medically
OL,9,Fassisted dying law to people whose sole
OL,10,Fcondition is mental illness, citing a
OL,11,Flack of consensus on who would be
OL,12,Feligible.
OL,14,FIt comes after a parliamentary panel
OL,15,Fearlier this year recommended that
OL,16,Fmedically assisted dying - known as
OL,17,FMaid in Canada - should not be
OL,18,Fexpanded.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
