OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACanada suspends plans to expand
OL,4,Aassisted dying to people with mental
OL,5,Aillness
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, Canada's justice
OL,8,Fminister, Sean Fraser, said that "while
OL,9,Fthere is not a perfect consensus on
OL,10,Fthis issue, we believe this is the
OL,11,Fcorrect approach at this particular
OL,12,Ftime".
OL,14,FSupporters of extending the programme
OL,15,Fto those with mental illness alone
OL,16,Fargue that not doing so violates their
OL,17,Fconstitutional rights and access to
OL,18,Fmedical care.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
